      <description><![CDATA[Adds a Refresh button (⌘R) and reconnects to devices that come back on Wi‑Fi, so an unlocked device no longer shows as locked. Apps your iPhone keeps in its App Library can now go to the iPad&#x27;s App Library too (a switch in the plan). Big home screens mirror more reliably.]]></description>
